{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012HF2QaWPJohWD6hSg49RRW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\t\n3\tnumber: 3\n4\ttitle: A pickup on another loan's due date is booked twice\n5\topened_by: Chen Wei (desk volunteer)\n6\tlabels: [bug]\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\tThe cordless drill (drill-01) is out on loan L-101, due back on the 13th. The reservation screen let\n10\tsomeone book it from the 13th. The member keeps a tool through its due date, so that date is taken.\n11\tTwo people turned up for one drill.\n12\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c724ed8-f38b-539c-814b-064a66a395bf","uuid":"59164b1a-189d-4bf9-8ac0-6df43572faa0","timestamp":"2026-11-13T04:57:52.720Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/weakwt/world/backlog/3-double-booking-on-due-date.md","content":"---\n\nnumber: 3\ntitle: A pickup on another loan's due date is booked twice\nopened_by: Chen Wei (desk volunteer)\nlabels: [bug]\n---\n\nThe cordless drill (drill-01) is out on loan L-101, due back on the 13th. The reservation screen let\nsomeone book it from the 13th. The member keeps a tool through its due date, so that date is taken.\nTwo people turned up for one drill.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012HF2QaWPJohWD6hSg49RRW","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
